flowchart TD
    Start((Start)) --> Login{User logged in?}
    Login -- No --> UserLogin[Show user login]
    UserLogin --> Login
    Login -- Yes --> Search[Search city/location]
    Search --> Slots[Load available parking slots]
    Slots --> Select[Select vehicle and slot]
    Select --> Available{Slot available?}
    Available -- No --> Search
    Available -- Yes --> Book[Create pending booking]
    Book --> Park[Record vehicle entry]
    Park --> Occupied[Set slot OCCUPIED]
    Occupied --> Exit[Record vehicle exit]
    Exit --> Duration[Calculate parking duration]
    Duration --> Method[Select Card, Cash, or Arrival]
    Method --> Payment[Create and save payment]
    Payment --> Complete[Complete booking and free slot]
    Complete --> End((End))
